<title>NORWAY: PGS 9-month pre-tax profits jump 34 pct.</title>
<headline>PGS 9-month pre-tax profits jump 34 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to september 30.</p>
<p>			    (millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p>Operating income	    2,154	vs	1,419</p>
<p>Operating result		462	vs	  298</p>
<p>Result before tax	     362	vs	  270</p>
<p>Result after tax		254	vs	  185</p>
<p>Earnings per share    9.39 crowns</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Norwegian seismic and offshore services company is Petroleum Geo-Services ASA. A Reuter poll of seven analysts forecast operating profits at 415 million crowns and a pre-tax result of 336 million crowns. Three recommended a buy on the share, three said hold and one said sell.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
